notification_templates.body:
Dear {{employee_name}},

Welcome to {{company_name}}! We are thrilled to welcome you as our new {{designation}} in the {{department}} team, commencing on {{joining_date}}.

Your employee self-service portal has been activated. Please log in using your corporate account to review onboarding requirements, verify your digital smart ID badge, and electronically sign company policies.

Portal URL: {{login_url}}
Username: {{username}}

Should you need any assistance, our HR Operations desk is available at hr@company.com.

Best regards,
People Operations Team
{{company_name}}

Dear {{employee_name}},

Your monthly salary for {{month}} has been processed and deposited to your {{bank_name}} account ending in {{account_mask}}.

Net Disbursed Amount: PKR {{net_salary}}

Your Section 149 Withholding Tax and statutory EOBI/SESSI deductions have been updated on your FBR ledger. You can inspect and download your encrypted electronic payslip by logging into the portal:

{{payslip_url}}

Warm regards,
Finance & Payroll Directorate
{{company_name}}

Dear {{employee_name}},

In accordance with our statutory governance framework, all personnel are required to review and electronically acknowledge {{policy_code}}: {{policy_title}} ({{version}}).

Compliance Deadline: {{deadline}}

Please follow this link to execute your electronic signature:
{{sign_url}}

Regards,
Corporate Governance & Compliance
{{company_name}}
